 ['intent','Why should the boxes not be rearranged yet?',['Their order may contain useful information','Urutan sekarang mungkin relevan sebagai bukti.'],[['They cannot physically be moved','Tidak ada larangan fisik permanen.'],['The teacher has already sold them','Sampel sudah didonasikan.'],['All numbers are written on the shelves','Nomor ada di bawah kotak.']],'their order may help','Perempuan ingin menjaga konteks sebelum perubahan.'],
 ['implied','What use remains possible for uncertain samples?',['Comparing their features in learning exercises','Ketidakpastian bisa dipakai untuk latihan membandingkan.'],[['Displaying them as definitively identified specimens','Tidak boleh berpura-pura tahu pasti.'],['Proving every student’s guess correct','Tidak ada jaminan kebenaran.'],['Replacing all verified specimens','Tidak diusulkan penggantian total.']],'use the uncertain samples for comparison exercises','Bahan belum pasti tetap berguna dengan label jujur.']
